WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:10.160
Hi. I wanted to record a quick video to talk about&nbsp;
Thank You Day. I thought about all the people I&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:16.160
wanted to thank for all the things they've done&nbsp;
for everybody around in the last 15 - 18 months.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:20.160
I suddenly realised there's just too many&nbsp;
people to thank, too many organisations, too&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:26.960
many fantastic people who've done amazing things.&nbsp;
I would like to say thank you to everybody. From&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:30.880
the neighbour who's knocked on a door of a&nbsp;
neighbour to check their okay, through to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:36.240
the organisations that have set up food banks&nbsp;
and delivering food to those that need it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:41.680
through to those who are helping combat loneliness&nbsp;
and isolation in this strange world we've been&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:41.680 --> 00:00:50.560
living in. All in all simply thank you. My&nbsp;
name is Martin Wigley thank you very much. Bye.

